&lt;p&gt;Icarus was founded on the belief that the Stratosphere is the &lt;a href=&quot;https://henryicarus.substack.com/p/the-forgotten-frontier?utm_campaign=post&amp;amp;utm_medium=web&amp;amp;triedRedirect=true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;Forgotten Frontier&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and that reclaiming it will define the next era of aerospace and what is possible from the sky. We build solar-powered aircraft that fly at 60,000 ft for weeks at a time, delivering persistent, affordable, and scalable presence from this layer of the atmosphere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;Mission&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Re-establish and maintain dominance in the Stratosphere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own every aspect of Icarus&#39; physical infrastructure. Your job is simple: build and maintain an environment where engineers can focus entirely on building aircraft. You will:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own our facilities end to end, from daily operations to long-term expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead factory buildouts, renovations, and infrastructure projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design factory layouts that improve engineering and manufacturing velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute equipment moves, machine installations, and production area expansions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own utilities including electrical, HVAC, compressed air, networking, and other critical infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage contractors, vendors, construction projects, permits, and inspections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop long-term facility roadmaps as the company grows into new buildings and manufacturing capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own physical security, badge access, maintenance programs, and site reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure our facilities are safe, organized, and always ready to support testing and production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove every physical bottleneck that slows engineers, technicians, and manufacturing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading facilities, factory infrastructure, manufacturing expansion, capital projects, or industrial construction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or expanding manufacturing facilities from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable managing multiple projects simultaneously in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of construction, utilities, mechanical systems, and industrial infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent project management and vendor management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized with exceptional attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-directed with extreme ownership. You identify problems before anyone else and solve them without waiting to be asked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to spend time both behind a computer and walking the factory floor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aerospace, automotive, robotics, or advanced manufacturing experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at SpaceX, Tesla, Anduril, Rivian, Amazon Robotics, or similar hardware companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting rapid company growth and facility expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;Why Icarus&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meaningful equity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top market salary and bonuses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health, dental, and vision insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Factory in El Segundo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real ownership, real hardware, real flight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Small team, massive responsibility (but growing very fast)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High signal (engineering) to noise (management) culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dream desk setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily lunch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited celsius&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;This is not a typical facilities job&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We don&#39;t think of facilities as a support function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At Icarus, the factory is one of our most important products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Every wall, machine, utility, workbench, production line, and square foot should make our engineers and technicians faster. Your mission is to build and continuously improve that environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll work closely with the CEO and leaders across engineering, manufacturing, flight operations, and business operations to ensure our facilities never become the bottleneck.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We move fast. We expect extreme ownership, sound judgment, and relentless execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No tourists. No bystanders. Only builders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;Hiring process&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intro call&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with the CEO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet the team in-person&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;US salary range&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;$140,000 - $200,000 USD&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are considered part of Icarus&#39; total compensation package.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. We welcome all applicants without attention to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Icarus was founded on the belief that the Stratosphere is the &lt;a href=&quot;https://henryicarus.substack.com/p/the-forgotten-frontier?utm_campaign=post&amp;amp;utm_medium=web&amp;amp;triedRedirect=true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;Forgotten Frontier&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and that reclaiming it will define the next era of aerospace and what is possible from the sky. We build solar-powered aircraft that fly at 60,000 ft for weeks at a time, delivering persistent, affordable, and scalable presence from this layer of the atmosphere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;Mission&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Re-establish and maintain dominance in the Stratosphere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;Dream job&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is for exceptional candidates only. If you meet our bar and believe you’d materially improve Icarus, apply here even if no current role fits you perfectly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;Why Icarus&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meaningful equity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top market salary and bonuses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health, dental, and vision insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Factory in El Segundo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real ownership, real hardware, real flight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Small team, massive responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High signal (engineering) to noise (management) culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dream desk setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily lunch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited celsius&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;This is not a normal engineering job&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are pioneers, not corporate managers. Icarus deliberately optimizes for a high signal (engineers) to noise (management) ratio, where engineering, flight, and execution matter more than process, politics, or management overhead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will work side by side with the CEO and a small team of world-class builders. You will own your subsystem end to end. Design it. Build it. Break it. Fix it. Validate it in the desert. Fly it. Then do it again, faster&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We expect full extreme ownership. This is a high-trust, no-BS team, and everyone pulls their weight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are hiring across the stack: mechanical, aerodynamics, RF, GNC, electrical, avionics, power electronics, energy storage, software, and systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We want builders. No hand-holding. No fluff. No fake projects. No slide decks. No sitting in meetings all day. Just raw engineering, real hardware, and real flight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You must thrive under pressure, learn fast, troubleshoot in the field, and push hardware to its limits. We move fast. We go to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Mojave at 4 am in the morning&lt;/strong&gt;. We expect results and an obsession with quality and speed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be a core executor of flight systems, taking them from concept to reality and driving rapid iteration loops. You will work across design, integration, testing, and flight. If you want real ownership, real hardware, and real flight milestones, this is it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No tourists. No bystanders. Only builders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;Hiring process&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One-on-one with CEO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet the team in-person&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;US salary range&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;$100,000 - $500,000 USD&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are considered part of Icarus&#39; total compensation package.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. We welcome all applicants without attention to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Icarus was founded on the belief that the Stratosphere is the &lt;a href=&quot;https://henryicarus.substack.com/p/the-forgotten-frontier?utm_campaign=post&amp;amp;utm_medium=web&amp;amp;triedRedirect=true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;Forgotten Frontier&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and that reclaiming it will define the next era of aerospace and what is possible from the sky. We build solar-powered aircraft that fly at 60,000 ft for weeks at a time, delivering persistent, affordable, and scalable presence from this layer of the atmosphere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;Mission&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Re-establish and maintain dominance in the Stratosphere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;Executive Producer, Content &amp;amp; Storytelling&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Icarus is looking for an Executive Producer, Content &amp;amp; Storytelling to capture, build and share the Icarus story as it happens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on Executive Producer role, not a traditional social media, marketing or production-management position. We want an exceptionally experienced, highly technical creator who can operate as a one-person production capability, from the factory floor to flight tests, remote airstrips, operational exercises and major company milestones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own the full content lifecycle: concept, capture, direction, photography, production, editing, animation, original music, sound, livestreaming, publishing and archive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The goal is simple: document the journey, build the Icarus brand and bring the mission to life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document Icarus: Capture aircraft development, manufacturing, flight tests, launches, deployments, exercises, milestones, successes, challenges and the people behind them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create Across Formats: Produce everything from commercial-grade advertising, product sizzles and social content to episodic YouTube series and documentary-length productions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the Narrative: Find and develop stories, not simply capture footage, and turn complex technology, operations, industry and human moments into compelling visual narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Social: Develop and execute content across platforms, with deep expertise in LinkedIn, YouTube and emerging channels, knowing when the moment calls for highly polished brand content versus raw, unfiltered or live field storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Production End-to-End: Concept, direct, shoot, light, photograph, record, edit, color, score, sound design, mix, create VFX, motion graphics and 3D animation, finish, version and deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create the Sound: Compose and produce original music, score to picture, cut picture to music, engineer audio, design sound and deliver professional-quality mixes. Audio is part of the storytelling, not an afterthought.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Go Live: Independently plan, produce and troubleshoot livestreams from launches, flight tests, demonstrations and events, including cameras, audio, networking, power, connectivity and technical infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Experiences: Bring the Icarus brand to life through factory visits, demonstrations, conferences, launches and other physical, digital and interactive experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the System: Own digital asset management and create a searchable, tagged and structured visual archive capable of supporting daily content, institutional memory, multi-platform distribution and future episodic or feature-length productions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Modern Tools: Apply modern creative software, automation, AI and technical tools to accelerate production, organization and distribution. Build new workflows or tools when existing ones aren&#39;t good enough.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Move Fast: Manage multiple concurrent productions, incorporate rapid feedback and deliver at the pace of a high-velocity aerospace startup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Protect the Mission: Exercise exceptional judgment around OPSEC, customer sensitivities, classification boundaries and competitive information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, proven experience as an end-to-end creator across commercial/advertising, social, episodic and long-form filmmaking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of professional production experience preferred, with significant experience independently owning productions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to operate as a solo or highly self-sufficient production presence for extended periods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Portfolio spanning commercial-grade work, documentary storytelling, high-energy content and authentic field production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant history producing YouTube content, including recurring episodic and long-form work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong command of LinkedIn and polished corporate/brand storytelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert cinematography, still photography, lighting and audio capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert editing, color, VFX, finishing and post-production capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong 3D animation and motion graphics experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional composition, music production, sound design, mixing and audio engineering capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with professional creative and design suites, including the ability to quickly master new or bespoke tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Livestream production, networking and remote field-connectivity expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to independently deploy, maintain and troubleshoot a complete professional production package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in remote, extreme, unpredictable and high-tempo environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional pre-production, logistics and operational planning skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing digital assets, metadata, versioning and multi-platform delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with modern software, automation and AI-enabled creative workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software engineering, networking, web development, interactive media or creative technology experience is a significant plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to create interactive digital experiences or tools that extend storytelling beyond traditional video is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable building systems and workflows rather than simply using them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interviewing skills across technical, operational and executive audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience earning and maintaining trusted access in sensitive working environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional creative judgment, discretion and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of OPSEC, responsible storytelling and information protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine passion for the Icarus mission, aviation, aerospace, technology and national security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;Why Icarus&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A lot of equity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top market salary and bonuses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health, dental, and vision insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Factory in El Segundo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real ownership, real hardware, real flight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Small team, massive responsibility (but growing very fast)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High signal (engineering) to noise (management) culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dream desk setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily lunch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited celsius&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;This is not a normal content creator job&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are pioneers, not corporate managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Icarus deliberately optimizes for high signal to noise. Engineering, manufacturing, flight, and execution matter more than process, politics, or management overhead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your job is not to add bureaucracy. Your job is to make the company move faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will work side by side with the CEO and a small team of world-class builders. You will help build the company behind the aircraft: the factory, the team, the systems, the rhythm, the culture, and the operational backbone that lets us move faster than companies 10x our size.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We expect full extreme ownership. This is a high-trust, no-BS team, and everyone pulls their weight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We want builders. No hand-holding. No fluff. No fake projects. No sitting in meetings all day. Just real execution, real hardware, real flight, and real company-building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You must thrive under pressure, learn fast, solve problems across functions, and push the company to operate at a higher level every week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We move fast. We go to Mojave at 4 am. We expect results and an obsession with quality and speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No tourists. No bystanders. Only builders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;US salary range&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;$180,000-210,000 USD&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are considered part of Icarus&#39; total compensation package.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. We welcome all applicants without attention to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Icarus was founded on the belief that the Stratosphere is the &lt;a href=&quot;https://henryicarus.substack.com/p/the-forgotten-frontier?utm_campaign=post&amp;amp;utm_medium=web&amp;amp;triedRedirect=true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;Forgotten Frontier&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and that reclaiming it will define the next era of aerospace and what is possible from the sky. We build solar-powered aircraft that fly at 60,000 ft for weeks at a time, delivering persistent, affordable, and scalable presence from this layer of the atmosphere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Flight Operations Crew Chief owns aircraft readiness. You assemble, prepare, inspect, and maintain our aircraft so they are safe and ready every time they go to the line. You are the person the team trusts to say the aircraft is ready to fly. When something is wrong with the airframe, you are the one who finds it and fixes it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;Mission&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Re-establish and maintain dominance in the Stratosphere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prepare the aircraft&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assemble, configure, and prepare aircraft for flight, including mechanical assembly, avionics connections, and payload setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run preflight inspections and checklists, and make the call on aircraft readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up and verify ground support equipment, power, and the physical test site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the configuration and condition of the aircraft from the hangar to the line.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain and troubleshoot&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and fix mechanical, electrical, and software issues on the aircraft in the field and in the hangar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform scheduled and unscheduled maintenance, repairs, and replacements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refurbish and reset the aircraft between flights and prepare it for the next sortie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain positive control of tools and hardware to keep the aircraft safe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow directions and intent from engineering personnel to make required adjustments on the fly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Document and improve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep accurate maintenance records, squawks, and configuration logs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed findings back to engineering to drive the next iteration of the aircraft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and improve the standard operating procedures that make aircraft readiness repeatable and safe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of hands-on aircraft, UAS, or RC maintenance experience, or equivalent military experience as a maintainer or crew chief.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holds or willing to quickly obtain FAA Part 107 certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to assemble, inspect, maintain, and sign off on an aircraft&#39;s readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on troubleshooting across mechanical, electrical, and software systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disciplined approach to checklists, documentation, and configuration control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgment on airworthiness and a willingness to ground an aircraft that is not ready.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort taking direction from engineers and translating it into a flight-ready aircraft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel frequently to remote test sites across the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator, non-negotiable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High trust, extreme ownership, no ego.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;Bonus&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FAA Airframe and Powerplant license or military aviation maintenance background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the Linux command line for debugging and troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with developmental flight test or build-up test programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background building RC or UAS aircraft (SAE Aero, Design Build Fly, or serious hobbyist).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aviation-adjacent military specialty with &quot;air sense&quot; (JTAC, CCT, etc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in austere or remote field environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;color: #0000ee;&quot;&gt;Why Icarus&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meaningful equity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top market salary and bonuses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health, dental, and vision insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Factory in El Segundo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real ownership, real hardware, real flight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Small team, massive responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High signal (engineering) to noise (management) culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dream desk setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily lunch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited celsius&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
